xt","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/s8SendableP"}}}